# Toolchain pinning for local development.
# - `asdf`, `mise`, `rtx`, `proto`, and `vfox` all read this file at the
#   repo root and switch versions automatically when you cd in.
# - CI uses the same versions in .github/workflows/ci.yml.
#
# Why the pin matters:
# - meeting-api parent POM enforces Java 17 (Maven Enforcer rule
#   `[17,18)` — apps/meeting-api/pom.xml). Java 21+ breaks the build.
# - meeting-web's CI matrix runs Node 20 (.github/workflows/ci.yml);
#   newer Node breaks @types resolutions on `tsc --noEmit`.
# - ai-worker pyproject.toml requires Python 3.11.
java 17.0.16
nodejs 20.18.0
python 3.11.9
